            "review_title": "Review at Spoonit House",
            "review_text": "Eldio\n1 contribution\n1\nBack to childhood\nMar 2019 • Friends\nSuch a special restaurant. Actually, I prefer to call this place a special house than a restaurant (once I come, I understand why they named Spoonit House). There is no wifi but true connection, no waste but proper healthy meals, no service but support. I like the way they make me feel like home from the very first time I step in by wearing slippers and their warm smiles. \nMy favorite corner is the small garden where I am surrounded by trees and vegetables. I can spend hours just to eat, chit-chat with friends or read a book. sometimes and totally forget my phone :)).\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2019",
