            "review_title": "Review at Spoonit House",
            "review_text": "Emma_Ng289\nHanoi, Vietnam14 contributions\n1\nHidden Charm in a Peaceful Corner of the City\nMar 2019 • Couples\nI was amazed at the very first time I saw Spoonit. I was located at an old apartment building which was built about 30 years ago. Visiting this Restaurant is like time travelling to me. However, the thing I love most about this place is its tranquil and fresh astmosphere despite being surrounded by the busy streets. I also love their little garden and the way they take good care of it as much as the way they take care of us. The food is truly amazing. They focus on the freshness and quality of their ingredients. I and my body really appreciate it. \nI am at peace whenever I am here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 8, 2019",
