            "review_title": "Review at Spoonit House",
            "review_text": "Dinh-Long P\n4 contributions\n1\nGood and Healthy Food, Eco-Friendly Packaging, Awesome Staff\nMar 2019 • Business\nThis place is great - for its food, its values, its staff. It's much more than a restaurant :)\n\n# FOOD #\nThe products are fresh and the salads healthy! I'm in love with all the sauces (that you can also buy individually). They have veggie and non-veggie options; both are great!\n\n# PACKAGING #\nThey don't use single-use plastics: the salad boxes when takeaway are made from sugarcane fibres and they give you stainless steel utensils and glass bottle for the sauce. They do organise many events around sustainability and eco-friendly lifestyle. \n\n# STAFF #\nStaff. Is. So. Lovely. \nMake sure to have a chitchat with them!!\n\n# WHY? #\nI ordered their dishes for personal (lunch & dinner) and professional uses (catering for events); Spoonit always made me happy!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 7, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
