            "review_text": "Minh Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n1\nBest healthy and eat-clean restaurant in town\nJan 2019 • Couples\nAt the first step I walked into Spoonit House (it located in an old apartment which is very “Hanoi”), I felt like all my stresses have been gone away. The atmosphere there was very special, peaceful, and so “green”. All things there are eco-friendly, and the foods are really good. Cuz I’m a saladholic so I odered roasted chicken and fresh mango for me and roasted salmon and Zuichini for my husband, OMG, they was fresher, tastier and better than i have ate in others restaurants. 5 stars for all the foods and services.c\nRead more\nWritten March 7, 2019\nSpoonit House\nThank you for visiting us. We hope that the time you and our husband spent at Spoonit House will be one of your peaceful memories in Hanoi and welcome back next time.\nRead more\nWritten March 7, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
